---
title: Hot 'N' Spicy Berry Cider
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Drinks
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@apple cider or juice{8%c}
@raspberries or strawberries{1%10-oz pkg}
@apple{1%medium} (cut into wedges)
@cinnamon sticks{4}
@whole cloves{1.5%tsp}

In a large sauce pan, combine apple cider or juice, berries, stick cinnamon, and cloves. Bring to boiling; reduce heat. Cover and simmer cider mixture for 10 minutes. Cool slightly. Strain the cider mixture through a large strainer lined with cheesecloth.
